    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="71.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 71.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf he to ðam kyncge furðor cyððe hæbbe—II hors, an gesadelod ⁊ oðer ungesadolod, ⁊ an swyrd ⁊ II spera ⁊ twegen scyldas ⁊ fiftig mancus goldes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he stands in a more intimate relationship to the king, it shall be two horses, one saddled and the other unsaddled, and one sword and two spears and two shields and 50 mancuses of gold.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif he to þam cingce furðor cyððe hæbbe: II hors, I gesadelod ⁊ oðer unsadelod, ⁊ swurd ⁊ II spera ⁊ II scyldas ⁊ L mances goldes.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
